# WebHarness Decision Log

## 格式说明

每条记录格式:
```
[TIMESTAMP] AGENT:Decision | Context | Outcome

示例:
[2026-05-09T12:00:00Z] planner:ARCH_CHOICE | SPA vs MPA | 选择 SPA
[2026-05-09T12:05:00Z] coder:API_DESIGN | REST vs GraphQL | 选择 REST
```

## 决策维度

- `ARCH_CHOICE`: 架构决策
- `API_DESIGN`: API 设计
- `TEST_STRATEGY`: 测试策略
- `DEPLOY_CONFIG`: 部署配置
- `TOOL_SELECTION`: 工具选型

